WEBVTT

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:02.056
kwamba wanaweza kuridhika na maendeleo yao,

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.016
na hapo ndipo ghafla

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:08.240
kwa maajabu wanatambua kipaji cha lugha ambacho walikuwa wanakosa maisha yao yote.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:11.656
Kwa hiyo kama umejaribu pia kujifunza lugha

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:14.096
na ukakata tamaa,

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.376
na kama huna kipaji cha lugha,

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:17.936
jaribu tena.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:20.816
Labda upo karibu kidogo na njia moja ya kuburudika

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.602
ili kujifunza lugha hiyo kwa ufasaha.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:26.896
Labda upo karibu kuja kuwa mwanaisimu.

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:28.136
Asante.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:32.360
(Makofi)